          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Perform the long division for "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 1 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Identify the repeating block of digits. Does it show cyclic properties if you evaluate "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 1 3 } ?"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Now compute "
